<p class=MsoNormal><b><span style='font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;
font-family:"Georgia",serif'>Your data protection rights</span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
"Verdana",sans-serif'>Under data protection law, you have rights including:</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;
font-family:"Verdana",sans-serif'>Your right of access</span></b><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:"Verdana",sans-serif'> -
You have the right to ask us for copies of your personal information. </span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;
font-family:"Verdana",sans-serif'>Your right to rectification</span></b><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:"Verdana",sans-serif'> -
You have the right to ask us to rectify personal information you think is
inaccurate. You also have the right to ask us to complete information you think
is incomplete. </span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;
font-family:"Verdana",sans-serif'>Your right to erasure</span></b><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:"Verdana",sans-serif'> -
You have the right to ask us to erase your personal information in certain circumstances.
</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;
font-family:"Verdana",sans-serif'>Your right to restriction of processing</span></b><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:"Verdana",sans-serif'> -
You have the right to ask us to restrict the processing of your personal
information in certain circumstances. </span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;
font-family:"Verdana",sans-serif'>Your right to object to processing</span></b><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:"Verdana",sans-serif'> -
You have the </span><span lang=EN style='font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;
font-family:"Verdana",sans-serif'>the right to object to the processing of your
personal information in certain circumstances</span><span style='font-size:
12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:"Verdana",sans-serif'>.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;
font-family:"Verdana",sans-serif'>Your right to data portability</span></b><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:"Verdana",sans-serif'> -
You have the right to ask that we transfer the personal information you gave us
to another organisation, or to you, in certain circumstances.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
"Verdana",sans-serif'>You are not required to pay any charge for exercising your
rights. If you make a request, we have one month to respond to you.</span></p>

